```yml
Fecha: [YYYY-MM-DD-HH-mm-ss]
Tipo: docs
Sección documentada: [Nombre/ruta]
Versión docs: [1.0]
Autor: [Nombre]
Archivos docs: [N]
Ejemplos añadidos: [N]
Revisor: [Nombre]
Estado: [Borrador/Publicado]
```

docs(scope): short description of documentation changes

Explain what documentation was added/updated:
- New sections added
- Existing sections updated
- Removed outdated content
- Improved clarity or examples

Type of documentation:
- README: [yes/no]
- API documentation: [yes/no]
- Architecture guides: [yes/no]
- Setup instructions: [yes/no]
- Examples/tutorials: [yes/no]
- Comments/docstrings: [yes/no]

Files affected:
- [file 1]: brief description
- [file 2]: brief description

Examples:
docs(readme): add installation and quick start guide
docs(api): document all endpoints with examples
docs(contribute): update contribution guidelines
docs(setup): add troubleshooting section
docs(code): improve docstrings in auth module

